		(uuid "8cc1d4ff-6d2a-5c06-9133-09347a6961ad")
	)
	(text "Budget (docs/design.md): +12V 2.5 A, +5V 2.5 A, -12V 1.0 A per rail; all rails together <= ~39 W out on a 45 W charger (~52 W on 60 W)"
