		(property "Note" "RESET, as usb-power SW1 (P021301 Rev B: contacts 1+3 common, 2 = NO). Press pulls U5 EN/UVLO to GND: U5 shuts down, VIN, EN_P and every rail turn off. Release: U5 restarts (fault cleared, soft ramp, rails in order) if VPD is in the 17.6-25.3 V window. R2 limits the pressed current to 0.2 mA. Case MP floating"
